  "label": "U.S. Political Polarization",
  "description": "The meme is designed for audiences engaged in or aware of the deep political divisions in the United States during the 2010s, particularly those who identify with or are mobilized by progressive Democratic politics. The call to action against Trump's cabinet members is framed as a form of collective resistance, appealing to individuals who see the Trump administration as a source of political and social conflict and who are motivated to take public stands against it.",
